  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Blas">Blas.</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">We cwædon be þam blaserum and be þam morð-slyhtum, þæt man dypte þone að be þryfealdum and myclade þæt ordalysen, þæt hit gewege þry pund, and eode se man sylf to, þe man tuge,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">With regard to incendaries and those who secretly compass death, we have declared that the oath shall be augmented threefold and the weight of the iron used in the ordeal shall be increased until it weighs three pounds.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">We declared about incendaries and underhand killings that the oath be deepened threefold and the ordeal-iron enlarged to a weight of three pounds.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">We cwedon be ðam blaserum 7 be ðam morðslihtum, þæt man dypte ðone að be ðryfealdum 7 myclade þæt ordalisen, ðet hit wǽge ðreo pund, 7 eode se man sylf to, ðe man tuge.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
